    <node id="Haiku">
      <data key="d0">Haiku</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Haiku is a Claude model variant optimized for speed and low cost, suitable for fast, lightweight tasks.&lt;SEP&gt;Haiku is a Claude model variant designed for fast, cheap, and simple tasks.&lt;SEP&gt;Haiku is a Claude model variant that is the fastest and cheapest, best suited for simple tasks.&lt;SEP&gt;Haiku is a Claude model variant that is fast and cheap, suited for simple tasks.&lt;SEP&gt;Haiku is a Claude model variant that is fast and cheap, recommended for quick tasks.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-025a86a4903e4e489cd42bedaffcb840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab74c3d2ad783400aacdc12951dd5004&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b97dc56900235cb8d228fef7c8405c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1694023022122e91d5653a390a57c8f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-047f3904283ca1416cabe7cde1e03247</data>
