    <node id="Sonnet">
      <data key="d0">Sonnet</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Sonnet is a Claude model variant offering a balanced performance and cost-effectiveness, recommended for drafting work.&lt;SEP&gt;Sonnet is a balanced and cost-effective Claude model variant suitable for general and deeper work, recommended for drafting.&lt;SEP&gt;Sonnet is a Claude model variant that balances speed and capability, recommended for many general uses including drafting and organizing work.&lt;SEP&gt;Sonnet is a Claude model variant that is balanced and recommended for general use, including drafting and organizing work.&lt;SEP&gt;Sonnet is a Claude model variant that is balanced and cost-effective, recommended for general work.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-025a86a4903e4e489cd42bedaffcb840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab74c3d2ad783400aacdc12951dd5004&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b97dc56900235cb8d228fef7c8405c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1694023022122e91d5653a390a57c8f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-047f3904283ca1416cabe7cde1e03247</data>
