    <node id="Opus">
      <data key="d0">Opus</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Opus is the most capable Claude model variant, best suited for complex reasoning and multi-step tasks, but more expensive.&lt;SEP&gt;Opus is the most capable Claude model variant, offering the best reasoning for complex and multi-step tasks, though it is costlier, recommended for verification.&lt;SEP&gt;Opus is a Claude model variant offering the best reasoning and multi-step task performance, though it is costlier than other variants.&lt;SEP&gt;Opus is a Claude model variant with the best reasoning capability, suited for multi-step planning and verifying complex work, but more expensive.&lt;SEP&gt;Opus is a Claude model variant with the best reasoning capability but is more expensive, recommended for complex reasoning tasks.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-025a86a4903e4e489cd42bedaffcb840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab74c3d2ad783400aacdc12951dd5004&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b97dc56900235cb8d228fef7c8405c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1694023022122e91d5653a390a57c8f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-047f3904283ca1416cabe7cde1e03247</data>
