    <node id="Model Context Protocol (MCP)">
      <data key="d0">Model Context Protocol (MCP)</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">MCP is a protocol that acts like a master key, allowing Claude broader control over applications on the user's behalf, going beyond standard API access.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-025a86a4903e4e489cd42bedaffcb840</data>
