    <node id="GitHub">
      <data key="d0">GitHub</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">GitHub is an online hosting platform for repositories, functioning like a shareable cloud storage service for code.&lt;SEP&gt;GitHub is an online platform that hosts repositories for collaboration and sharing, functioning similarly to a public cloud storage service for code.&lt;SEP&gt;GitHub is an online platform where repositories are shared and collaborated on, similar to a shared Google Drive for code.&lt;SEP&gt;GitHub is an online platform where repositories are shared and collaborated on, similar to a shared Google Drive.&lt;SEP&gt;GitHub is an online platform where repositories are shared and collaborated on, referenced as a source of external links that users should verify.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-025a86a4903e4e489cd42bedaffcb840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab74c3d2ad783400aacdc12951dd5004&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b97dc56900235cb8d228fef7c8405c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1694023022122e91d5653a390a57c8f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-047f3904283ca1416cabe7cde1e03247</data>
