    <node id="Terminal / CLI">
      <data key="d0">Terminal / CLI</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The terminal or CLI (Command-Line Interface) is a text-based interface for controlling a computer and running commands.&lt;SEP&gt;The Terminal/CLI (Command-Line Interface) is a text-based interface used to give commands to a computer, such as opening folders or running installations.&lt;SEP&gt;The terminal or command-line interface (CLI) is a text-based tool for instructing a computer to perform tasks instead of using a graphical interface.&lt;SEP&gt;The Terminal or CLI (Command Line Interface) is a text-based interface used to give commands to a computer, relevant to running Claude Code.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-025a86a4903e4e489cd42bedaffcb840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab74c3d2ad783400aacdc12951dd5004&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b97dc56900235cb8d228fef7c8405c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1694023022122e91d5653a390a57c8f6</data>
