    <node id="VS Code">
      <data key="d0">VS Code</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">VS Code is a commonly used code editor or IDE that can be used alongside Claude.&lt;SEP&gt;VS Code (Visual Studio Code) is a popular code editor widely used for software development.&lt;SEP&gt;VS Code is a popular code editor used for software development.&lt;SEP&gt;VS Code is a popular code editor developed by Microsoft, inside which Claude can run.&lt;SEP&gt;VS Code is a popular code editor in which Claude can run; it is the basis for the anti-gravity workspace mentioned by the presenter.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-025a86a4903e4e489cd42bedaffcb840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab74c3d2ad783400aacdc12951dd5004&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b97dc56900235cb8d228fef7c8405c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1694023022122e91d5653a390a57c8f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-047f3904283ca1416cabe7cde1e03247</data>
