    <node id="Cursor">
      <data key="d0">Cursor</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Cursor is a code editor or IDE that can be used with Claude.&lt;SEP&gt;Cursor is a paid code editor option built on VS Code, mentioned as an alternative to Anti-Gravity.&lt;SEP&gt;Cursor is a paid alternative code editor used for software development.&lt;SEP&gt;Cursor is an alternative paid code editor, mentioned as an option alongside VS Code.&lt;SEP&gt;Cursor is a paid code editor alternative to VS Code, mentioned as an option for working with Claude Code.</data>
