    <node id="Vercel">
      <data key="d0">Vercel</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Vercel is a front-end deployment and hosting tool used for publishing user interfaces and web apps.&lt;SEP&gt;Vercel is a platform used for front-end deployment, allowing users to publish web applications for others to access.&lt;SEP&gt;Vercel is a platform used for front-end deployment, serving as an example of a front-end hosting service.&lt;SEP&gt;Vercel is a front-end deployment platform used as an example of a front-end service in the context of building apps with Claude.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-025a86a4903e4e489cd42bedaffcb840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab74c3d2ad783400aacdc12951dd5004&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b97dc56900235cb8d228fef7c8405c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-047f3904283ca1416cabe7cde1e03247</data>
