      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Supabase is a back-end platform providing server and database logic, used as a back-end tool in Claude-assisted projects.&lt;SEP&gt;Supabase is a back-end platform providing server, data, and logic services for web applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Supabase is a platform used for back-end services, serving as an example of a back-end system.&lt;SEP&gt;Supabase is a back-end service used as an example of a back-end platform when describing front-end/back-end architecture.</data>
