      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Notion is an application that can be integrated with Claude via the Notion API, serving as an example of an external app that Claude can interact with.&lt;SEP&gt;A Notion document is planned to be shared by the creator to summarize the video content and outline plans for a follow-up on Claude features.</data>
