    <node id="Deployment">
      <data key="d0">Deployment</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Deployment is the process of publishing an app or project so that others can access it.&lt;SEP&gt;Deployment is the process of publishing an application so that others with permission can access it.&lt;SEP&gt;Deployment refers to publishing a project so that others can access it.&lt;SEP&gt;Deployment refers to the process of publishing an application so that others can access it.</data>
