    <node id="Every Claude Code Concept Explained For Non-Techies">
      <data key="d0">Every Claude Code Concept Explained For Non-Techies</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">A 20-minute educational video explaining 23 Claude Code concepts for beginners, organized into four parts covering workspace basics, building with AI, connecting systems, and power features, plus bonus tips.&lt;SEP&gt;A video (20:15) created by a presenter that explains Claude and Claude Code concepts in four parts plus a bonus section, targeting non-technical audiences.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-025a86a4903e4e489cd42bedaffcb840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b97dc56900235cb8d228fef7c8405c7</data>
