      <data key="d5">1774122166</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Compact Conversation">
      <data key="d0">Compact Conversation</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Compact conversation is a command that shrinks the current chat history to free up context window space, useful when conversation history is large.&lt;SEP&gt;Compact conversation is a technique to compress chat history in order to free up context window space so Claude focuses on essential information.&lt;SEP&gt;Compact conversation is a command that shrinks or condenses chat history so Claude uses less of the context window.&lt;SEP&gt;Compact conversation is a Claude Code feature that condenses chat history to save context tokens during a session.&lt;SEP&gt;A command in Claude Code that shrinks chat history to save context space and reduce token usage.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-025a86a4903e4e489cd42bedaffcb840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab74c3d2ad783400aacdc12951dd5004&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b97dc56900235cb8d228fef7c8405c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1694023022122e91d5653a390a57c8f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-047f3904283ca1416cabe7cde1e03247</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1774122166</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="/Clear">
      <data key="d0">/Clear</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">/clear is a command that clears the chat context entirely to allow a fresh start.&lt;SEP&gt;A command in Claude Code that clears the chat context.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-025a86a4903e4e489cd42bedaffcb840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab74c3d2ad783400aacdc12951dd5004</data>
