    <node id="/Resume">
      <data key="d0">/Resume</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">/resume is a command that restores a recent conversation after clearing, avoiding the need to retype previous context.&lt;SEP&gt;A command in Claude Code that resumes a cleared or previous conversation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-025a86a4903e4e489cd42bedaffcb840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab74c3d2ad783400aacdc12951dd5004</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
