    <node id="Prompt">
      <data key="d0">Prompt</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A prompt is the natural language instruction given to Claude to direct its actions or outputs.&lt;SEP&gt;A prompt is a natural-language instruction given to an AI to direct its actions or outputs; clarity and specificity improve results.&lt;SEP&gt;A prompt is the instruction given to Claude in natural language to direct its actions.&lt;SEP&gt;A prompt is a natural-language instruction given to an AI model, specifying what the user wants it to do.&lt;SEP&gt;A prompt is a user instruction written in plain language given to Claude, analogous to ordering at a restaurant, used to direct Claude's responses and actions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-025a86a4903e4e489cd42bedaffcb840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab74c3d2ad783400aacdc12951dd5004&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b97dc56900235cb8d228fef7c8405c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1694023022122e91d5653a390a57c8f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-047f3904283ca1416cabe7cde1e03247</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1774122166</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
