      <data key="d0">Tools</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Tools in Claude Code refer to capabilities such as reading files, writing files, and running bash/shell commands, which Claude can perform if granted permission.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-025a86a4903e4e489cd42bedaffcb840</data>
