      <data key="d0">Slashinit (/Init)</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Slashinit (/init) is a command used to create a claude.md long-term memory file at the start of a project.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ab74c3d2ad783400aacdc12951dd5004</data>
