      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Anti-Gravity is a VS Code-based workspace used as an alternative code editor, preferred by the video creator for being free.&lt;SEP&gt;Anti-gravity is a code editor or IDE that integrates Claude agents, usable alongside Claude for building projects.</data>
