    <node id="Token">
      <data key="d0">Token</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Tokens are the unit of usage for Claude, roughly corresponding to words, used to measure input and output and determine costs.&lt;SEP&gt;Tokens are the units of computation and cost used by Claude, roughly corresponding to words, with Claude supporting up to 1 million tokens of input/output context.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1b97dc56900235cb8d228fef7c8405c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1694023022122e91d5653a390a57c8f6</data>
