      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Checkpoints and Undo is a Claude Code feature that auto-saves project states and allows users to revert changes if needed.&lt;SEP&gt;Checkpoints &amp; Undo is a feature where Claude auto-saves progress and provides options to revert changes to earlier states.</data>
