    <node id="Tools (Read/Write/Bash)">
      <data key="d0">Tools (Read/Write/Bash)</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Tools refer to capabilities granted to Claude to view files (read), create or edit files (write), and run shell commands (bash) on a user's machine, with permissions governing access.&lt;SEP&gt;Tools in Claude Code refer to capabilities granted to Claude, including reading files, creating/editing files (write), and running shell commands (bash), which can be controlled for safety.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1b97dc56900235cb8d228fef7c8405c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-047f3904283ca1416cabe7cde1e03247</data>
