      <data key="d0">/Init Command</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The /init command initializes a project and creates the project MD file (claude.md) for long-term memory storage.&lt;SEP&gt;The /init command is a Claude Code command used to create a claude.md file that stores long-term project memory for a project.</data>
