      <data key="d0">/Clear Command</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">/clear is a command used to clear the session chat and reset Claude's short-term memory.&lt;SEP&gt;The /clear command is a Claude Code command used to clear the chat history and free up context tokens.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1b97dc56900235cb8d228fef7c8405c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-047f3904283ca1416cabe7cde1e03247</data>
