    <edge source="Life Audit" target="AI">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">AI is used to analyze patterns, self-deception, and highest-leverage changes identified during a Life Audit.&lt;SEP&gt;AI is used to facilitate a life audit by identifying patterns, self-deception, and the highest-leverage change in each life area based on honest self-descriptions.</data>
