    <edge source="Personal Operating System" target="AI">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">AI is used to distill personal values, regrets, and lessons into a set of guiding principles forming a Personal Operating System.&lt;SEP&gt;AI distills an individual's regrets, proud moments, and lessons into a personal operating system of 5–7 guiding principles.</data>
      <data key="d9">construction,principle distillation,tool application</data>
