    <edge source="Personal Operating System" target="ChatGPT">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">ChatGPT helps build a personal operating system by distilling the user's regrets, proud moments, and values into guiding principles.&lt;SEP&gt;ChatGPT distills a user's regrets, proud moments, and values into 5–7 core principles that form a personal operating system.</data>
