    <edge source="Accountability System" target="Tiny-Habit Design">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Accountability System is built upon Tiny-Habit Design principles to create a motivation-independent approach to habit maintenance.</data>
      <data key="d9">behavioral framework,habit formation</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-c19ebc4badbd8262c8487882ac0285a9</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1774122034</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Accountability System" target="Dopamine">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Accountability System is designed as an alternative to motivation, which is framed as unreliable due to dopamine's role in anticipation rather than reward.&lt;SEP&gt;The accountability system is designed to work around the fading of dopamine-driven motivation after planning, replacing willpower with structured support.&lt;SEP&gt;Because dopamine is tied to anticipation rather than sustained action, motivation is unreliable, making a structured accountability system necessary.</data>
      <data key="d9">behavioral science,habit design,motivation,motivation critique,motivation limitation,system necessity</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-c19ebc4badbd8262c8487882ac0285a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c69eb46b9fdf4cfbf2d4e228fde1a76&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eb01cd2d607a14da2729a2994a8833a</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1774122035</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Accountability System" target="AI">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">AI checks in, tracks streaks, adjusts the system, and supports shame-free restarts within the Accountability System.&lt;SEP&gt;AI helps design and maintain accountability systems using the tiny habits approach, tracking streaks and enabling shame-free resets.</data>
      <data key="d9">design,habit support,habit tracking,tool application</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-c19ebc4badbd8262c8487882ac0285a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eb01cd2d607a14da2729a2994a8833a</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1774122036</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Accountability System" target="ChatGPT">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">ChatGPT powers the accountability system by conducting check-ins, tracking streaks, adjusting plans, and enabling shame-free restarts.&lt;SEP&gt;ChatGPT helps design an accountability system with small habit starters, check-ins, streak tracking, and shame-free restarts.</data>
      <data key="d9">behavioral support,design,habit support,habit tracking</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-2c69eb46b9fdf4cfbf2d4e228fde1a76&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3cdd347d2c888fa651c16760dc54aac4</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1774122040</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Accountability System" target="BJ Fogg">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The accountability system incorporates BJ Fogg's "so small you can't fail" approach to habit initiation.</data>
      <data key="d9">habit formation,methodology</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-2c69eb46b9fdf4cfbf2d4e228fde1a76</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1774122040</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Accountability System" target="Tiny Habits">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Tiny habits, associated with BJ Fogg, form the behavioral foundation of the motivation-proof accountability system.&lt;SEP&gt;The tiny habits approach serves as the foundational design principle for building accountability systems that do not rely on motivation.</data>
      <data key="d9">behavioral foundation,design principle,foundation,habit design</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-3cdd347d2c888fa651c16760dc54aac4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eb01cd2d607a14da2729a2994a8833a</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1774122041</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Emotional Trigger Decoding" target="Original Wound">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Emotional Trigger Decoding aims to trace reactions back to the original wound as a foundational source of emotional patterns.&lt;SEP&gt;Emotional trigger decoding is a process aimed at tracing intense reactions back to their original wound or deeper recurring emotional pattern.</data>
      <data key="d9">emotional source,psychological exploration,root cause analysis,tracing</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-c19ebc4badbd8262c8487882ac0285a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c69eb46b9fdf4cfbf2d4e228fde1a76</data>
