    <edge source="Claude" target="Context Window">
      <data key="d7">4.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Claude's short-term memory is governed by the context window, which has a token limit that can be filled during long conversations.&lt;SEP&gt;Claude uses the context window as its short-term memory, which holds chat history and has a size limit.&lt;SEP&gt;Claude uses the context window as short-term memory for the current chat session, subject to token limits.&lt;SEP&gt;The context window defines Claude's short-term memory capacity during a chat session, limiting how much information it can retain at once.</data>
      <data key="d9">computation,limitation,memory,memory management,usage limit</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-025a86a4903e4e489cd42bedaffcb840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab74c3d2ad783400aacdc12951dd5004&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1694023022122e91d5653a390a57c8f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-047f3904283ca1416cabe7cde1e03247</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1774122170</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Claude" target="Tokens">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Claude charges users based on token consumption, making it important to monitor usage.&lt;SEP&gt;Tokens measure Claude's usage and associated cost, with heavier usage requiring users to consider a paid plan.&lt;SEP&gt;Claude's usage is measured in tokens, and the number of tokens consumed directly affects the cost to the user.</data>
      <data key="d9">cost,usage,usage metering</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-025a86a4903e4e489cd42bedaffcb840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab74c3d2ad783400aacdc12951dd5004&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-047f3904283ca1416cabe7cde1e03247</data>
