    </edge>
    <edge source="Claude" target="Plan Mode">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Plan mode is a permissions setting for Claude recommended for live or sensitive projects to ensure safety before edits are made.&lt;SEP&gt;Plan mode is a permission mode in Claude that generates plans without modifying code, recommended for important projects.&lt;SEP&gt;Plan mode is a Claude permission setting that prevents edits, allowing users to safely review planned actions before committing.</data>
      <data key="d9">permission,permissions,safe editing,safety</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-025a86a4903e4e489cd42bedaffcb840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1694023022122e91d5653a390a57c8f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-047f3904283ca1416cabe7cde1e03247</data>
