    <edge source="/Clear" target="/Resume">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">/clear clears the chat context while /resume restores a recent conversation, working together to manage context without losing prior work.&lt;SEP&gt;The /resume command allows users to bring back a conversation that was previously cleared using /clear.</data>
      <data key="d9">context management,continuity,conversation continuity,recovery</data>
